  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A hydrating, multi-use highlighter stick for cheeks, eyes, lips, and body formulated with 64% skincare that delivers a long-lasting, glassy glow.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Sea Fennel Extract: A bio-retinoid that mimics the visible smoothing and fortifying benefits of retinol without irritation.<br>- Wakame Extract: A marine algae that supports the barrier to protect skin.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and retains moisture.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Glide on ethereal glass skin without disturbing makeup underneath.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>- Glide directly from the precise slim form with light strokes in one direction, or warm up the formula with your fingertip and gently dab anywhere. <br> -Blend and diffuse with the HAUS LABS Dual-Ended Multi-Purpose Brush (sold separately) or fingers. <br>- Layer to intensify wet, glass skin effect.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Sea Fennel Extract: A bio-retinoid that mimics the visible smoothing and fortifying benefits of retinol without irritation.<br>-Wakame Extract: A marine algae that supports the barrier to protect skin.<br>-Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and retains moisture.<br><br>Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Octyldodecanol, Polybutene, Diisostearyl Malate, Synthetic Wax, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, VP/Hexadecene Copolymer, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Arnica Montana Flower Extract (Fermented), Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Crithmum Maritimum Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Squalane, Pseudozyma Epicola/Apricot Kernel Oil/Olive Fruit Oil/Sweet Almond Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil/Licorice Root Extract Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Camellia Sinensis Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Apricot Kernel Oil/Olive Fruit Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil/Sweet Almond Oil/(Angelica Gigas/Lithospermum Erythrorhizon) Root Extract Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Sunflower Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Tin Oxide, Mica, CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
