rate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Tin Oxide, Mica, CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
